From 7d45d01d80ec67858e2be90ad6396dfa1e3300ea Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <claude@anthropic.com>
Date: Sat, 25 Jul 2026 09:31:38 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Security hardening, lifecycle gap fixes, leave balances, UX
 pass

Security (critical):
- Block privilege escalation via app_users self-update (guard trigger on
  role/segments/permission_overrides/salary/is_active)
- Prevent super-admin password takeover in create-user edge function
- Stop lead-book enumeration via find_duplicate_leads (boolean-only check
  for restricted staff)
- Record failed logins; restrict spoofable anon audit-log inserts
- Segment-scope leave & advance approvals (were cross-segment)

Broken workflows:
- Allow bulk_upload lead source (Excel import was failing every time)
- IST-safe dates everywhere (UTC slice wrote yesterday's date 00:00-05:30 IST)
- Keep interested leads with the caller; add Unassigned Pool with claim
- Camera cancel no longer force-submits check-in

Logic:
- Server-side late detection (device clock can no longer defeat it)
- Punctuality uses is_late, not a hardcoded 10 AM cutoff
- Payslip auto-fill counts real working days, not calendar days
- Notify staff when leave/advance decided; validate + surface errors
- Telecaller conversions count direct closes, not just handoffs
- create-user honors role_permissions, matching the UI

Lifecycle gaps:
- Assign a work shift during onboarding (late tracking was dead for new hires)
- Force password change after admin-set credentials
- Notify managers when a telecaller/executive is onboarded
- Pool self-claim so restricted staff can cold-start
- Gate HR sub-tabs per permission

Leave balances (new):
- leave_policies + derived balance RPC (working-day aware)
- Over-approval guard with approver override
- Balance cards for staff, inline balances for approvers, HR policy editor

UX & cleanup:
- Grouped nav (Me/Admin) replacing 20-item mobile scroll
- Overview uses count queries instead of full table scans
- QuickSearch opens records; notifications navigate
- Onboarding password generate/copy + per-step validation
- Public ticket/contact forms surface errors
- Phone normalization; readAsArrayBuffer for imports
- Split recharts/xlsx chunks: StaffPortal 541KB -> 154KB
- Remove dead storage.ts (wrong brand seed), useScrollAnimation, .htaccess
- Register service worker; drop pre-auth GPS prompt
